&lt;h2 id="garden-description">Garden Description&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>A. The &lt;a href="http://vocab.getty.edu/page/aat/300004145">portico&lt;/a> which bordered the &lt;a href="http://vocab.getty.edu/page/aat/300080971">peristyle&lt;/a> garden on the north and east side was accessed from the entrance hall. This site had been extensively damaged prior to excavation.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>B. The east &lt;a href="http://vocab.getty.edu/page/aat/300004145">portico&lt;/a> gave access to the narrow garden to the back of the house.&lt;/p>
